mdpreview 0.4 (2026-10-28)

 * Copying text no longer puts a line break wherever the preview wrapped
   a line. Paragraphs, headings, list items and quotes are copied as one
   line each, and wrapped lines in code blocks are rejoined; table cells
   and real line breaks keep theirs.
 * MuPDF is now built with its Noto symbol fonts (-DTOFU_CJK instead of
   -DTOFU -DTOFU_CJK), so characters such as U+25B6 are drawn instead of
   empty boxes. The plugin grows from about 10 MB to 19 MB.

mdpreview 0.3 (2026-10-28)

 * Fix the right-click menu: Copy, Select All, Copy Link Address and
   Reload Preview did nothing.
 * Clicking in the preview no longer scrolls it to the top.
 * Reload Preview also re-reads the stylesheet and changed images.
 * Licence notices for MuPDF and the libraries and data it bundles
   (packaging/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt), included in the .deb together
   with the AGPL-3.0 text and the source offer.

mdpreview 0.2 (2026-10-28)

 * Follow the desktop font DPI / text scaling (HiDPI).

mdpreview 0.1 (2026-10-28)

 * First release.
